#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/error-mitigation/extracted-outputs/20296b5a-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/error-mitigation/extracted-outputs/20296b5a-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note: As shown above, the circuit with $k$ time steps will have $4k$ two-qubit gate layers.\n"
msgstr "Uwaga: Jak pokazano powyżej, obwód z $k$ krokami czasowymi będzie miał $4k$ warstw bramek dwukubitowych.\n"

